### Third-Party Data & Imagery Acknowledgments

- **Satellite Remote Sensing Imagery**: Selected satellite imagery datasets are sourced and curated from Verygoogmaps for educational, spatial study, and aesthetic cartographic appreciation.
- **National & Regional Standard Maps**: Standard geographic and transport network maps are based on officially published standard maps (China Ministry of Natural Resources / Provincial Mapping Bureaus) for public cartographic reference and educational visualization.
- All geographic boundaries, place names, and cartographic elements remain the intellectual property of their respective creators and official cartographic agencies.
